# Context & handoff

- Durable decisions live under `artifacts/`, not only in chat.
- Near context limits, end of session, or assignee switch → run `handoff`.
- Multi-week / multi-decision work → `wayfinder` instead of one giant PLAN.
- Async stakeholder input → `to-questionnaire`, then fold answers back into SPEC.
